															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1304786); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1304786&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608974012" alt="TL333s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1304786)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1304786); return false;" >TL333s</a></span> <span class="odate time_1503663468 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">25 Aug 2017 12:17</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3578240">
									

<blockquote>
<p>A lot of the fun of reading SCPs is the dramatic irony that comes from you puzzling something together, but the Foundation doesn't, because they're either thinking too scientifically</p>
